  <img src="../img/butterfly.gif" />
</figure>

<h1 class="poem__title">{{ title }}</h1>

<div class="poem__stanza">
  <p>we were just talking about you;</p>
</div>

<div class="poem__stanza">
  <p>a butterfly perched itself</p>
  <p>atop my fingertip,</p>
  <p>stopping to take in the moment.</p>
</div>

<div class="poem__stanza">
  <p>they told me it was you</p>
  <p>visiting us for a little while,</p>
  <p>but that would imply</p>
  <p>that you flew off</p>
  <p>and left us again that evening.</p>
</div>
